OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, frosty and sunny
OL,6,Fmorning, then becoming increasingly
OL,7,Fcloudy with a few scattered showers
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon. Feeling chilly,
OL,9,Fthough only a light breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA scattering of showers
OL,12,Fpersisting this evening and overnight,
OL,13,Flocally heavy by dawn across Cumbria.
OL,14,FCold again with a patchy frost under
OL,15,Fany clear spells and a breeze picking
OL,16,Fup.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
