OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FChilly to start the weekend
OL,6,Fwith showery outbreaks of rain in
OL,7,FCumbria. Generally, more cloudy but
OL,8,Fmostly dry in the south. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening into the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBecoming
OL,12,Fmore changeable through the period
OL,13,Fwith spells of rain, showers and
OL,14,Fstronger winds, interspersed by drier
OL,15,Fand brighter interludes. Temperatures
OL,16,Falso recovering closer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
